{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:55 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:55 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:55 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"「光輝歲月」終於捉到鹿\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/b35fc4af2c07ad4e696fd05a54fee72a/2026-11/r3_3.jpg\"/><p>今日編有三場泥地賽事，路程全是一六五○米，結果第三場五班賽事，由周俊樂策騎的游廄「光輝歲月」反先續配黃寶妮爭連捷的東廄「一鹿歡騰 」，贏得歷來第二場勝仗。之前兩仗，「光輝歲月」都與「一鹿歡騰 」同場而成績遜於對方。周俊樂季內已第七次助游達榮贏馬，兩人合作如魚得水。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fe2e9b3ead866312ccfd8f16b300f3c1/2026-11/r33.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b0ea61f3be8945a0da8ca9c1723199e6/2026-11/r34.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f7fd2b1569a722ff2beae431262a1bf5/2026-11/r35.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2490d10eb5f4fa9f15ccdb74a742e305/2026-11/r36.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:54:05.524342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:55:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:16.615412+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:32.258813+00:00","content_hash":"59aa12685e1803a19a42bcf0836ed67e58d386851aa0c0c8d02304eee0f3aab3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}